# Tailscale + SSHFS schedule
# Install with: crontab -e (then paste the relevant lines)
#
# === Mac (context provider) ===
# Connect at 9am, disconnect at 6pm (weekdays)
# 0 9 * * 1-5  /usr/local/bin/tailscale up
# 0 18 * * 1-5 /usr/local/bin/tailscale down
#
# === EC2 (context consumer) ===
# Mount 5 min after Tailscale is up, unmount before it goes down
# 5 9 * * 1-5  /path/to/mount-context.sh 100.x.y.z your-mac-user
# 55 17 * * 1-5 /path/to/unmount-context.sh
